<!-- department-details-section -->
<section class="department-details-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="accordian-box">
                    <h3>Become a member</h3>
                    <form  action="/" class="contact-form" method="post" >
                        <div class="row row-gutter-10">
                            <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
                                <input type="text" id="firstname" class="input-text" name="name" placeholder="Firstname" aria-required="true" required>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
                                <input type="text" id="lastname" class="input-text" name="name" placeholder="Lastname" aria-required="true" required>
                            </div>

                            <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
                                <input type="email" id="email" class="input-text" placeholder="Email address" name="email" aria-required="true" required>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
                                <input type="text" id="phone" class="input-text" placeholder="Phone number" name="phone" aria-required="true" required>
                            </div>

                            <div class="col-12 col-lg-12">
                                <button class="btn btn-primary">Join</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-12 col-lg-6 col-xl-6">
                <!-- accordian-box -->
                <div class="accordian-box">
                    <h3 style="text-align: end;">Read this for support</h3>
                    <div class="accordian-box-item">
                        <div class="accordian-title">
                            <h5>What why having PSF membership?</h5>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordian-content">
                            <p>PSF membership helps the set of people and businesses including corporations who collectively has an agreement to work with PSF.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordian-box-item">
                        <div class="accordian-title">
                            <h5>What is membership?</h5>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordian-content">
                            <p>The term “Member” in relation to PSF means, one who has agreed to become the member of PSF by registering their name as a membe. Every person who has agreed in writing to become a part of PSF and also holds shares of the company is considered the <b>Member of the PSF</b> and is said to hold membership in a company.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordian-box-item">
                        <div class="accordian-title">
                            <h5>What is the difference between Member and Shareholder</h5>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordian-content">
                            <p>A member is a person whose name is entered in the register of members of a company Whereas a Shareholder is a person who owns the shares of the company.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordian-box-item">
                        <div class="accordian-title">
                            <h5>Outline the steps to become a member of PSF?</h5>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordian-content">
                            <li><strong>Choose Your Membership Category:</strong>Decide whether you would like to apply for Corporate Membership or Bi-lateral Membership based on your business or organizational profile..</li>
                            <li>Fill and submit the Membership Application Form.</li>
                            <li>Pay for membership.</li>
                            <li>Confirm the membership.</li>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>